With `{instance}` in filename position the artifact is `notes/alpha.md`, and the reported key is the
slug the placeholder matched — the segment's `.md` suffix is stripped back off. Paired with
`a-nested-instance-path-keys-on-the-matched-directory-segment.txtar`, which differs only in the
machine's `artifact:` shape.

